{"seq":1,"slug":"pallet-pattern-unitization-wrapping","title":"托盘堆码/缠绕/规格与单元化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/pallet-container-loading/pallet-pattern-unitization-wrapping","wordCount":1899,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"托盘堆码-缠绕-规格与单元化\">托盘堆码/缠绕/规格与单元化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>托盘是装载链条的第一个&quot;聚合层&quot;：把几十只散箱变成一个可以被叉车整体搬运的<strong>单元</strong>。单元化的收益是叉车作业次数从上百次降到一次，代价是托盘自身占用的体积与重量——一只欧标托盘自重约 25kg、高 144mm，这些都要从载具的可用空间里扣掉。</p>\n<p>托盘装载（palletization，也叫 pallet building）要解的不是&quot;怎么把箱子塞进一个矩形&quot;，而是三个目标同时成立：<strong>垛型稳定</strong>（运输中不散、不倒）、<strong>底面完全利用</strong>（不要伸出托盘导致磕碰，也不要缩得太小导致浪费）、<strong>高径比合理</strong>（太高会倒，太矮浪费垂直空间）。三者互相冲突，托盘图案（pallet pattern）的选择就是这三者的权衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[已装箱队列] --&gt; B[箱尺寸聚类]&#10;  B --&gt; C[托盘图案生成]&#10;  C --&gt; D{稳定性检查}&#10;  D --&gt;|底面利用率低| E[换图案/交错层]&#10;  D --&gt;|超出边沿| F[改行列数]&#10;  D --&gt;|通过| G[层数与垛高计算]&#10;  G --&gt; H{高径比 &amp; 限重}&#10;  H --&gt;|过高| I[减少层数/换托盘]&#10;  H --&gt;|通过| J[缠绕膜方案]&#10;  J --&gt; K[生成托盘单元 + SSCC]\">graph TD\n  A[已装箱队列] --&gt; B[箱尺寸聚类]\n  B --&gt; C[托盘图案生成]\n  C --&gt; D{稳定性检查}\n  D --&gt;|底面利用率低| E[换图案/交错层]\n  D --&gt;|超出边沿| F[改行列数]\n  D --&gt;|通过| G[层数与垛高计算]\n  G --&gt; H{高径比 &amp; 限重}\n  H --&gt;|过高| I[减少层数/换托盘]\n  H --&gt;|通过| J[缠绕膜方案]\n  J --&gt; K[生成托盘单元 + SSCC]</pre><h2 id=\"托盘规格\">托盘规格</h2><h3 id=\"主流规格与选型\">主流规格与选型</h3><p>托盘尺寸的选择会反向影响箱型设计——这是一个常被忽略的双向耦合。全球最常见的两种是 1200×800mm（欧标，EPAL 体系）与 1200×1000mm（常见于亚洲与部分国际海运），北美则有 48×40 英寸（约 1219×1016mm）。规格一旦确定，箱型的最优外廓就被这个模数约束了。</p>\n<p>欧标托盘 EPAL 1 的可核验参数是：长 800mm、宽 1200mm、高 144mm，自重约 25kg，安全工作载荷 1500kg；在平整实心地面上堆码承载托盘时，<strong>最底层托盘承受的载荷不得超过 5500kg</strong>（见 <a href=\"https://www.epal-pallets.org/eu-en/load-carriers/epal-euro-pallet\">EPAL Euro pallet</a>）。最后这条常被忽略：它是&quot;整垛总重&quot;的约束，而不是单只托盘的承载能力。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规格</th>\n<th>尺寸 (mm)</th>\n<th>常见区域</th>\n<th>典型自重</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>EPAL 1（欧标）</td>\n<td>800 × 1200 × 144</td>\n<td>欧洲</td>\n<td>约 25kg</td>\n<td>安全载荷 1500kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工业托盘</td>\n<td>1000 × 1200 × 150</td>\n<td>亚洲、海运</td>\n<td>20–35kg</td>\n<td>尺寸因厂而异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GMA 北美</td>\n<td>1219 × 1016 × 约 140</td>\n<td>北美</td>\n<td>约 16–20kg（木）</td>\n<td>英制 48×40 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半托</td>\n<td>800 × 600</td>\n<td>零售陈列</td>\n<td>较小</td>\n<td>常见于商超补货</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"材质与跨国合规\">材质与跨国合规</h3><p>木质托盘跨国流通受植物检疫管辖。ISPM 15 规则的木质包装植物检疫措施<strong>包含垫木</strong>，但排除经过处理而不再有害虫风险的木制品（如胶合板）；标准同时声明这些措施并非提供持续防护（见 <a href=\"https://www.ippc.int/en/publications/640/\">IPPC ISPM 15</a>）。工程含义是：木托采购必须有 IPPC 标识与处理证据，且&quot;处理过的托盘&quot;仍需保持标识可读。塑料托盘与压合板托盘不受此约束，这是跨境场景下选择它们的现实理由之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图案生成\">图案生成</h2><h3 id=\"行列切分与交错\">行列切分与交错</h3><p>最常用的图案生成是<strong>行列切分</strong>（block / column stacking）：把托盘底面按箱底面积切分成若干行列，全部箱子同向排列。它的优点是稳定、易机械化，缺点是当箱长宽与托盘尺寸不整除时会留下边条浪费。</p>\n<p>改进手段是<strong>混合图案</strong>：底面用两到三种朝向组合，让箱子的长边填满某一区域的短边空隙。经典的 pinwheel（风车）图案就是用一个&quot;旋转块&quot;吃掉边角。工程实现上通常预生成一批候选图案模板（含列切分、交错、风车），再对每种模板计算底面利用率与稳定性评分，取最优。</p>\n<h3 id=\"底面利用率与悬垂\">底面利用率与悬垂</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>箱边超出托盘边的距离</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_{base} = \\frac{\\sum_i a_i}{A_{pallet}}, \\qquad overlap_{max} = \\max_i(\\text{箱边超出托盘边的距离})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4118em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4777em;vertical-align:-0.7277em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7277em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">箱边超出托盘边的距离</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_{base}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 高不一定好：如果箱子<strong>悬垂</strong>（overhang）出托盘边沿太多，边角的箱子会失去支撑而在缠绕后仍可能塌陷。经验规则是悬垂尽量为零，允许极小量（如不超过箱边长的 5%）。因此图案评分应当是&quot;利用率高 <strong>且</strong> 悬垂为零&quot;的联合判据，而不是单一最大化利用率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"层间交错与稳定性\">层间交错与稳定性</h3><p>同向堆叠的整垛在侧向力下容易整体滑移。交替旋转 90° 的交错层（interlocked layers）能大幅提升抗滑移能力，代价是层高可能因箱子高度一致而无损、且在混合图案中实现更复杂。一个可用的默认策略是：<strong>偶数层用同向图案，奇数层旋转 90°</strong>，前提是旋转后仍不悬垂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"垛型与约束\">垛型与约束</h2><h3 id=\"垛高与高径比\">垛高与高径比</h3><p>整垛高度受两个约束夹逼：载具的净高（集装箱内高、车厢内高）与<strong>高径比</strong>。高径比通常按整垛高度与托盘短边之比衡量，比值过大时侧向稳定性急剧下降。没有任何普适的安全比值——它取决于缠绕质量、货物摩擦系数、以及运输中的加速度谱——所以高径比阈值必须由自家运输测试或历史倾倒事件反推，而不是照搬某个数字。</p>\n<h3 id=\"限重与层间承压\">限重与层间承压</h3><p>整垛重量受三重限制：单箱 BCT 决定的堆码层数上限（见 <a href=\"../dimension-packaging-masterdata/packaging-material-library-selection\">包材库与选型</a>）、托盘自身的安全载荷、以及载具的载重限制。三者取最小。计算时必须从<strong>最底层</strong>开始累加其上全部重量——压坏底层的永远不是它自己那层。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def max_layers_by_strength(carton_bct_n, carton_gross_kg, pallet_safe_kg, env_factor):&#10;    # 自下而上累积：第 n 层(自顶向下)承载其上方所有箱重&#10;    layers = 0&#10;    load_above = 0.0&#10;    while True:&#10;        allowable = carton_bct_n * env_factor / 9.80665   # N -&gt; kgf&#10;        if load_above + carton_gross_kg &gt; allowable:&#10;            break&#10;        if (layers + 1) * carton_gross_kg &gt; pallet_safe_kg:&#10;            break&#10;        load_above += carton_gross_kg&#10;        layers += 1&#10;    return layers\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> max_layers_by_strength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(carton_bct_n, carton_gross_kg, pallet_safe_kg, env_factor):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 自下而上累积：第 n 层(自顶向下)承载其上方所有箱重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    load_above </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        allowable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carton_bct_n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env_factor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 9.80665</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # N -> kgf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_above </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carton_gross_kg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> allowable:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carton_gross_kg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pallet_safe_kg:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        load_above </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carton_gross_kg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> layers</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>env_factor</code> 是环境折减（湿度、时长、堆码方式），必须实测。这个循环也说明了为什么&quot;标称承重&quot;不能直接当层数上界：真实可堆层数总是显著小于标称值除以单箱重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缠绕与单元标识\">缠绕与单元标识</h2><h3 id=\"缠绕膜方案\">缠绕膜方案</h3><p>缠绕（stretch wrapping）的作用是把垛体变成一个整体，靠薄膜的预拉伸回弹力提供约束。关键参数是<strong>预拉伸率</strong>（pre-stretch，常见 150–250%）、<strong>绕层数</strong>（底部与顶部加密）、以及<strong>包覆高度</strong>（是否含托盘木脚）。包覆高度需覆盖托盘本身才有效，因为薄膜必须把货物和托盘绑在一起，只包货不包托等于没包。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单元标识\">单元标识</h3><p>每个托盘单元需要唯一标识才能被下游追踪。GS1 的 SSCC（Serial Shipping Container Code）是 18 位数字，由扩展位、GS1 公司前缀、序列参考与校验位组成，通常用 GS1-128 条码承载，也可写进 RFID 标签，且 SSCC 常用于提前发货通知（ASN）EDI 报文，它<strong>适用于三级包装</strong>（tertiary level of packing，即托盘/物流单元层级），见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serial_Shipping_Container_Code\">Serial Shipping Container Code</a>。把 SSCC 打在托盘标签上，是托盘单元进入后续运输与清关数据链的入场券。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;handlingUnitId&quot;: &quot;HU-000123456789012345&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sscc&quot;: &quot;000123456789012345&quot;,&#10;  &quot;labelFormat&quot;: &quot;GS1-128&quot;,&#10;  &quot;palletType&quot;: &quot;EPAL_1&quot;,&#10;  &quot;patternTemplate&quot;: &quot;column_5x3_interlocked&quot;,&#10;  &quot;layers&quot;: 6,&#10;  &quot;cartonsPerLayer&quot;: 15,&#10;  &quot;grossWeightG&quot;: 612000,&#10;  &quot;stackHeightMm&quot;: 1410,&#10;  &quot;baseUtilization&quot;: 0.94,&#10;  &quot;overhangMm&quot;: 0,&#10;  &quot;wrap&quot;: { &quot;preStretchPct&quot;: 200, &quot;layers&quot;: 4, &quot;wrapPalletBase&quot;: true }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"handlingUnitId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HU-000123456789012345\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sscc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"000123456789012345\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"labelFormat\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GS1-128\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"palletType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EPAL_1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"patternTemplate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"column_5x3_interlocked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"layers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cartonsPerLayer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"grossWeightG\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">612000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"stackHeightMm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1410</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"baseUtilization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.94</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"overhangMm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"wrap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"preStretchPct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"layers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"wrapPalletBase\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个结构同时是给下游装载算法的输入：有了整垛的净高与自重，集装箱层才能算一个柜能装几垛（见 <a href=\"container-uld-3d-loading-weight\">集装箱/ULD 三维装箱与重心配平</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>托盘是装载的第一层聚合，收益是作业次数骤降，代价是自重与 144mm 级的高度占用。</li>\n<li>托盘规格反向约束箱型最优外廓，选规格要先于选箱型档位。</li>\n<li>底面利用率与悬垂必须联合判据，悬垂为零比利用率高更重要。</li>\n<li>层间交错提升抗滑移；垛高受载具净高与高径比夹逼，高径比阈值必须实测而非照搬。</li>\n<li>可堆层数由纸箱 BCT、托盘安全载荷、载具载重三者取最小，且从最底层累计其上全部重量。</li>\n<li>缠绕必须包住托盘木脚；托盘单元用 SSCC（18 位、GS1-128）标识并进入 ASN 数据链。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸\">延伸</h2><p>整垛之后是载具：如何把托盘装进集装箱并配平重心，见 <a href=\"container-uld-3d-loading-weight\">集装箱/ULD 三维装箱与重心配平</a>；哪些货不能相邻、哪些不能被压，见 <a href=\"mixed-load-separation-stack-limit\">混装隔离与限重/堆叠约束</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"托盘堆码/缠绕/规格与单元化","id":"托盘堆码-缠绕-规格与单元化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"托盘规格","id":"托盘规格"},{"level":3,"text":"主流规格与选型","id":"主流规格与选型"},{"level":3,"text":"材质与跨国合规","id":"材质与跨国合规"},{"level":2,"text":"图案生成","id":"图案生成"},{"level":3,"text":"行列切分与交错","id":"行列切分与交错"},{"level":3,"text":"底面利用率与悬垂","id":"底面利用率与悬垂"},{"level":3,"text":"层间交错与稳定性","id":"层间交错与稳定性"},{"level":2,"text":"垛型与约束","id":"垛型与约束"},{"level":3,"text":"垛高与高径比","id":"垛高与高径比"},{"level":3,"text":"限重与层间承压","id":"限重与层间承压"},{"level":2,"text":"缠绕与单元标识","id":"缠绕与单元标识"},{"level":3,"text":"缠绕膜方案","id":"缠绕膜方案"},{"level":3,"text":"单元标识","id":"单元标识"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸","id":"延伸"}],"prev":{"title":"计费重 DIM 与运费成本联动（联067）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/cartonization-algorithm/dimensional-weight-freight-link"},"next":{"title":"集装箱/ULD 三维装箱与重心配平","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/pallet-container-loading/container-uld-3d-loading-weight"}}